{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION WINS $1.36 BILLION FOREIGN MILITARY SALES CONTRACT', 'text': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN WINS $1.36 BILLION FOREIGN MILITARY SALES CONTRACT NORTHROP GRUMMAN (NOC) HAS BEEN AWARDED A $1.36 BILLION CONTRACT FROM THE US NAVY TO PRODUCE NINE E-2D ADVANCED HAWKEYE AIRCRAFT UNDER A FOREIGN MILITARY SALES CONTRACT WITH JAPAN, THE PENTAGON WEBSITE SAID WEDNESDAY.'}